# Agent harness state
# `.claude/worktrees/` holds linked git worktrees the agent harness creates, each a full
# checkout of this repository. Git keeps them out of `git status` once they are registered,
# but the enclosing `.claude/` directory itself reports as one untracked path -- which is
# enough to make `npm run commit` refuse every commit, because it compares the porcelain set
# before and after staging and an untracked directory does not expand the same way a file
# does. Narrow on purpose: only the worktrees, so a future decision to track `.claude`
# settings or skills is not pre-empted by this line.
.claude/worktrees/
